"outputs/d1829257-b7a4-49d9-8ac2-3d6230165427-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Toffoli gate, too, can be decomposed into CNOTs, along with some other "
"gates. However, it is significantly more complicated than the SWAP gate "
"decomposition, so it will be left as an optional exercise at the end of the "
"module to explore and verify this decomposition.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gate Toffoli juga bisa didekomposisi menjadi CNOT, bersama dengan beberapa "
"Gate lainnya. Namun, ini jauh lebih rumit daripada dekomposisi Gate SWAP, "
"sehingga akan dibiarkan sebagai latihan opsional di akhir modul untuk "
"mengeksplorasi dan memverifikasi dekomposisi ini.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Measurements {#measurements-1}"
msgstr "Pengukuran {#measurements-1}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Measurements play a special role in quantum computing — one that has no "
"classical computing analog. While in classical computing, you can check your"
" bits at any point of your choosing during an algorithm, in quantum "
"computing, you must be very selective about when to look at your qubits "
"because measurement collapses their state and destroys the superposition "
"that gives qubits their computational complexity.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pengukuran memainkan peran khusus dalam komputasi kuantum — peran yang tidak"
" memiliki analog dalam komputasi klasik. Sementara dalam komputasi klasik, "
"kamu bisa memeriksa bit-bit kamu di titik mana pun yang kamu pilih selama "
"suatu algoritma, dalam komputasi kuantum, kamu harus sangat selektif tentang"
" kapan harus melihat qubit-mu karena pengukuran meruntuhkan keadaannya dan "
"menghancurkan superposisi yang memberi qubit kompleksitas komputasinya.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In particular, given an $N$-bit quantum state $\\vert \\psi\\rangle = "
"\\sum_{i=0}^{2^N-1} c_i \\vert i\\rangle$, a measurement will collapse the "
"state to one of the basis functions $\\vert i\\rangle$ with a probability "
"equal to $\\vert c_i\\vert ^2$.\n"
msgstr ""
"Secara khusus, diberikan keadaan kuantum $N$-bit $\\vert \\psi\\rangle = "
"\\sum_{i=0}^{2^N-1} c_i \\vert i\\rangle$, sebuah pengukuran akan "
"meruntuhkan keadaan ke salah satu fungsi basis $\\vert i\\rangle$ dengan "
"probabilitas sama dengan $\\vert c_i\\vert ^2$.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"But this destructive effect of a measurement isn't always a hindrance. It is"
" in fact a key resource in certain algorithms and protocols, such as "
"[quantum teleportation](/learning/modules/computer-science/quantum-"
"teleportation) and [quantum key distribution](/learning/modules/computer-"
"science/quantum-key-distribution).\n"
msgstr ""
"Tapi efek destruktif dari pengukuran ini tidak selalu menjadi hambatan. Ini "
"sebenarnya adalah sumber daya kunci dalam algoritma dan protokol tertentu, "
"seperti [teleportasi kuantum](/learning/modules/computer-science/quantum-"
"teleportation) dan [distribusi kunci kuantum](/learning/modules/computer-"
"science/quantum-key-distribution).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In Qiskit, when a measurement is made, it is sent to a classical register "
"where it is stored as a classical bit. Creating a circuit with a measurement"
" looks like this:\n"
msgstr ""
"Di Qiskit, ketika pengukuran dilakukan, pengukuran tersebut dikirim ke "
"register klasik di mana disimpan sebagai bit klasik. Membuat Circuit dengan "
"pengukuran terlihat seperti ini:\n"

