# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "3. Executing {#3-executing}"
msgstr "3. Eksekusi {#3-executing}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After preparing the circuit, we can now run it on the quantum computer!\n"
msgstr ""
"Setelah mempersiapkan Circuit, kita sekarang bisa menjalankannya di komputer"
