#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Short Answer Questions {#short-answer-questions}"
msgstr "Pertanyaan Jawaban Singkat {#short-answer-questions}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "What are some primary differences between a bit and a qubit?\n"
msgstr "Apa saja perbedaan utama antara bit dan qubit?\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "What happens to a quantum state when it is measured?\n"
msgstr "Apa yang terjadi pada keadaan kuantum ketika diukur?\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Why do we use little-endian notation in Qiskit?\n"
msgstr "Mengapa kita menggunakan notasi little-endian di Qiskit?\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "What are the four steps in the Qiskit patterns workflow?\n"
msgstr "Apa saja empat langkah dalam alur kerja Qiskit patterns?\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Challenge Questions: {#challenge-questions}"
msgstr "Pertanyaan Tantangan: {#challenge-questions}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In the module, we only used the adder to add classically allowed states for "
"$A$ and $B$. But we can also prepare $A$ and $B$ in superpositions! Change "
"the code to prepare each qubit in an equal superposition of 0 and 1, then "
"run the new circuit and obtain a new histogram. What do you see? Explain "
"what is happening.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dalam modul ini, kita hanya menggunakan adder untuk menjumlahkan keadaan "
"yang diizinkan secara klasik untuk $A$ dan $B$. Tapi kita juga bisa "
"mempersiapkan $A$ dan $B$ dalam superposisi! Ubah kode untuk mempersiapkan "
"setiap qubit dalam superposisi yang sama dari 0 dan 1, lalu jalankan Circuit"
" baru dan dapatkan histogram baru. Apa yang kamu lihat? Jelaskan apa yang "
"terjadi.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Toffoli gate decomposition. Use `decompose()` to show how the Toffoli gate "
"is decomposed into single- and two-qubit gates, then verify this "
"construction with matrix multiplication. Keep in mind that although circuit "
"diagrams are read left to right, matrices are applied to quantum states "
"right to left!\n"
msgstr ""
"Dekomposisi Gate Toffoli. Gunakan `decompose()` untuk menunjukkan bagaimana "
"Gate Toffoli didekomposisi menjadi Gate satu dan dua qubit, lalu verifikasi "
"konstruksi ini dengan perkalian matriks. Ingat bahwa meskipun diagram "
"Circuit dibaca dari kiri ke kanan, matriks diterapkan ke keadaan kuantum "
"dari kanan ke kiri!\n"
